  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Why the collector stopped collecting. Reads the collector_health measurement, which the collector writes to the local InfluxDB on every failed poll and once when an outage ends - so it is populated exactly when the AlphaESS API is unreachable and the container log is the only other record.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
      },
      "description": "Is collection happening right now? Green while the newest sample is under 5 minutes old, red past that -- the collector's poll loop never exits on failure, so \"container up\" says nothing. Matches the 'AlphaESS collector data stale' alert exactly. Ignores the time picker: this is always about now.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "from": 0,
                "result": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "ALL OK"
                },
                "to": 300
              },
              "type": "range"
            },
            {
              "options": {
                "from": 300,
                "result": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "OUTAGE"
                },
                "to": 999999999
              },
              "type": "range"
            },
            {
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 2,
                  "text": "NO DATA"
                }
              },
              "type": "special"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 300
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 32
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
          },
          "query": "// Age of the newest sample, in seconds. Deliberately the same signal as the\n// provisioned \"AlphaESS collector data stale\" alert (and the same 300s\n// threshold), so this panel and the alert can never disagree.\n//\n// Data staleness rather than the collector_health events, because an outage\n// is \"no data is arriving\", whatever the cause: a failing poll loop writes\n// failure events, but a dead container, a wrong bucket or a broken datasource\n// write nothing at all -- and those must show red too, not a stale \"ALL OK\".\n//\n// Fixed -1h lookback, not the time picker: the question is \"right now\", which\n// must not change when the dashboard is set to 7d.\nfrom(bucket: \"alphaess\")\n  |> range(start: -1h)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"power_readings\" and r._field == \"soc_percent\")\n  |> last()\n  |> map(fn: (r) => ({_time: r._time, _value: float(v: int(v: now()) - int(v: r._time)) / 1000000000.0}))\n  |> keep(columns: [\"_time\", \"_value\"])\n  |> yield(name: \"data_age\")\n",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Collector status",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
      },
      "description": "Polls that raised an error in the selected range. A handful spread over days is normal upstream flakiness; a cluster is an outage.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "fixedColor": "text",
            "mode": "fixed"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "0"
                }
              },
              "type": "special"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 5,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"alphaess\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"collector_health\" and r.event == \"failure\" and r._field == \"failures\")\n  |> group()\n  |> count()\n  |> yield(name: \"failed_polls\")",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Failed polls",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
      },
      "description": "Distinct outages: one per run of consecutive failures that ended in a successful poll. An outage still in progress is not counted here yet - check 'Recent failures'.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "fixedColor": "text",
            "mode": "fixed"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "0"
                }
              },
              "type": "special"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"alphaess\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"collector_health\" and r.event == \"recovered\" and r._field == \"failures\")\n  |> group()\n  |> count()\n  |> yield(name: \"outages\")",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Outages",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
      },
      "description": "Longest gap in collection, first failed poll to the poll that recovered. Green under 5 minutes (one backoff cap), red over 30.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 300
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1800
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 15,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"alphaess\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"collector_health\" and r.event == \"recovered\" and r._field == \"outage_seconds\")\n  |> group()\n  |> max()\n  |> yield(name: \"longest_outage\")",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Longest outage",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
      },
      "description": "Time since the last failed poll. Large and rising is the healthy state.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "fixedColor": "text",
            "mode": "fixed"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
          },
          "query": "// Fixed long lookback, not the time picker: \"no failure in the selected\n// range\" would otherwise read as a suspiciously large uptime.\nfrom(bucket: \"alphaess\")\n  |> range(start: -90d)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"collector_health\" and r.event == \"failure\" and r._field == \"failures\")\n  |> group()\n  |> last()\n  |> map(fn: (r) => ({_time: r._time, _value: float(v: int(v: now()) - int(v: r._time)) / 1000000000.0}))\n  |> yield(name: \"since_last_failure\")",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Since last failure",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
      },
      "description": "Failed polls per interval, split by exception type. SSLError/TLS EOF points at the container MTU (local, fixable - see DEPLOY.md); ReadTimeout and HTTPError on a valid path point at the AlphaESS API itself (nothing to do but wait).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "barWidthFactor": 0.6,
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "normal"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "hideZeros": false,
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"alphaess\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"collector_health\" and r.event == \"failure\" and r._field == \"failures\")\n  |> group(columns: [\"error_class\"])\n  |> aggregateWindow(every: v.windowPeriod, fn: count, createEmpty: false)\n  |> yield(name: \"failures\")",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Failures by error class",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "${DS_ALPHAESS}"
      },
      "description": "The failures themselves, newest first, with the error the collector saw. This is the log line the Uptime Kuma alert is telling you about - readable from a phone, without opening a terminal.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto",
              "wrapText": true
            },
            "filterable": true,
            "inspect": false
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
